# Deny everything, then name what the build needs. The whole context is sent to
# the daemon before the first COPY runs — .venv alone is 700MB — and this is
# also what keeps .env out of the image if a COPY line is ever widened.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!accounts
!app
!core
!kb
!observability
!pii
!rag

# Re-excluded after the directories above: host bytecode is the wrong
# interpreter's, and uv compiles its own in the builder.
**/__pycache__
